{"id": "gid://shopify/Page/163944169695", "page": {"body": "<div class=\"sl-activity-hub\">\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       BREADCRUMB\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <nav class=\"sl-activity-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Ruta de navegación\">\n    <a href=\"/\">Inicio</a>\n    <span aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span>\n\n    <a href=\"/pages/guias\">Guías</a>\n    <span aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span>\n\n    <span aria-current=\"page\">\n      Actividad y necesidad\n    </span>\n  </nav>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       HERO\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-activity-hero\">\n\n    <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n      GUÍAS SPORTLAND\n    </span>\n\n    <h2>\n      Encuentra tenis según lo que necesitas hacer\n    </h2>\n\n    <p>\n      Explora guías según\n      <strong>running, deporte, trabajo o necesidad específica</strong>\n      y descubre qué características conviene revisar\n      antes de elegir tu próximo par.\n    </p>\n\n\n    <nav class=\"sl-activity-jumpnav\" aria-label=\"Secciones de actividad y necesidad\">\n\n      <a href=\"#running\">\n        Running\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"#deporte\">\n        Deporte\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"#trabajo\">\n        Trabajo\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"#necesidades\">\n        Necesidades\n      </a>\n\n    </nav>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- SPORTLAND CONTENT INTELLIGENCE · RUTAS POR ACTIVIDAD 2026-11-08 -->\n  <section class=\"sl-activity-section\" id=\"guias-por-actividad\" aria-labelledby=\"sl-subhubs-title\">\n    <div class=\"sl-section-heading\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">ELIGE UNA RUTA</span>\n        <h2 id=\"sl-subhubs-title\">Profundiza según tu actividad</h2>\n      </div>\n      <p>Estas guías explican qué revisar para cada uso antes de comparar tecnologías, tallas y modelos.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sl-guide-grid\">\n      <a href=\"/pages/guia-running-tenis-para-correr\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n        <span>RUNNING</span>\n        <strong>Tenis para correr</strong>\n        <p>Elige según distancia, pisada, ajuste y tipo de entrenamiento.</p>\n        <b>Ver guía de running →</b>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"/pages/que-tenis-necesitas-para-entrenar-aprende-a-elegirlos\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n        <span>ENTRENAMIENTO</span>\n        <strong>Tenis para gimnasio y fuerza</strong>\n        <p>Compara estabilidad, tracción y sujeción para el ejercicio que realizas.</p>\n        <b>Ver guía de entrenamiento →</b>\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"/pages/guia-de-padel\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n        <span>PÁDEL</span>\n        <strong>Calzado y equipo de pádel</strong>\n        <p>Entiende cancha, desplazamientos y características del equipo adecuado.</p>\n        <b>Ver guía de pádel →</b>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       FEATURED\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-featured\">\n\n    <div class=\"sl-section-heading\">\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n          GUÍAS DESTACADAS\n        </span>\n\n        <h2 id=\"sl-featured-title\">\n          Empieza por estas rutas\n        </h2>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <p>\n        Las guías más consultadas, con video y comparativa de modelos.\n      </p>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"sl-featured-layout\">\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/los-5-mejores-tenis-para-hacer-pierna-y-porqu\" class=\"sl-feature-card sl-feature-card--main\">\n        <span class=\"sl-feature-card__tag\">GIMNASIO · CON VIDEO</span>\n        <strong>Mejores tenis para hacer pierna</strong>\n        <p>Training, halterofilia o suela plana: qué usar según tu rutina, con video y comparativa de modelos.</p>\n        <span class=\"sl-card-action\">Ver guía <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span>\n      </a>\n\n      <div class=\"sl-featured-secondary\">\n        <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/mejores-tenis-para-voleibol-del-2022-top-10\" class=\"sl-feature-card\">\n          <span class=\"sl-feature-card__tag\">VOLEIBOL · CON VIDEO</span>\n          <strong>Mejores tenis para voleibol</strong>\n          <p>Tracción, estabilidad lateral y amortiguación para jugar en cancha.</p>\n          <span class=\"sl-card-action\">Ver guía <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span>\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/tenis-para-estar-de-pie-mucho-tiempo-top-5-2021\" class=\"sl-feature-card\">\n          <span class=\"sl-feature-card__tag\">TRABAJO · CON VIDEO</span>\n          <strong>Tenis para estar de pie mucho tiempo</strong>\n          <p>Qué comparar en amortiguación, ajuste y estabilidad cuando pasas el día de pie.</p>\n          <span class=\"sl-card-action\">Ver guía <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       RUNNING\n       Running sigue siendo una sección, NO un hub independiente.\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-activity-section\" id=\"running\" aria-labelledby=\"sl-running-title\">\n\n    <div class=\"sl-section-heading\">\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n          RUNNING\n        </span>\n\n        <h2 id=\"sl-running-title\">\n          Guías para correr según superficie, distancia y pisada\n        </h2>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <p>\n        Empieza por dónde corres, cuánto quieres correr\n        y qué tipo de sensación buscas\n        antes de comparar modelos concretos.\n      </p>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"sl-guide-grid\">\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/tenis-para-correr-en-pavimento-top-5-2022\" class=\"sl-guide-card sl-guide-card--accent\">\n\n        <span>SUPERFICIE</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis para correr en pavimento\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Amortiguación, suela, estabilidad y ajuste\n          para asfalto y concreto.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/tenis-para-correr-largas-distancias-de-mujer-top-5\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>DISTANCIA</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis para largas distancias\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Qué cambia al preparar 10K,\n          medio maratón o maratón.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/pronaci-n-que-es-y-que-tenis-debo-usar\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>PISADA</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Pronación: qué es y cómo elegir tenis\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Entiende la diferencia entre pronación normal,\n          sobrepronación y estabilidad.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/los-mejores-tenis-supinadores-y-porque\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>PISADA</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis para supinadores\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Qué revisar en modelos neutrales,\n          amortiguación, ajuste y flexibilidad.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/pages/tecnologias-de-tenis\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>TECNOLOGÍAS</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Entiende la amortiguación\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Compara mediasuelas, espumas,\n          suelas y tecnologías antes de elegir.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver tecnologías →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       DEPORTE\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-activity-section\" id=\"deporte\" aria-labelledby=\"sl-deporte-title\">\n\n    <div class=\"sl-section-heading\">\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n          DEPORTE Y ENTRENAMIENTO\n        </span>\n\n        <h2 id=\"sl-deporte-title\">\n          Tenis según tu actividad deportiva\n        </h2>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <p>\n        Cada actividad exige una combinación diferente\n        de estabilidad, tracción, flexibilidad,\n        amortiguación y soporte.\n      </p>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"sl-guide-grid\">\n\n      <!-- GIMNASIO -->\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/los-5-mejores-tenis-para-hacer-pierna-y-porqu\" class=\"sl-guide-card sl-guide-card--accent\">\n\n        <span>GIMNASIO</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis para hacer pierna\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Opciones para entrenamientos donde la estabilidad\n          y el contacto con el suelo importan.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <!-- VOLEIBOL · PRIMARY PAGE -->\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/mejores-tenis-para-voleibol-del-2022-top-10\" class=\"sl-guide-card sl-guide-card--accent\">\n\n        <span>VOLEIBOL</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Mejores tenis para voleibol\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Compara opciones para jugar en cancha según\n          tracción, estabilidad, amortiguación,\n          ajuste y tipo de juego.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía de voleibol →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <!-- TENIS · SL-HUB-20261124 -->\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/mejores-tenis-para-jugar-tenis\" class=\"sl-guide-card sl-guide-card--accent\">\n        <span>TENIS</span>\n        <strong>Mejores tenis para jugar tenis</strong>\n        <p>Soporte lateral, suela según la cancha y 5 modelos recomendados, con video.</p>\n        <b>Ver guía de tenis →</b>\n      </a>\n\n\n      <!-- PÁDEL · SL-HUB-20261124 -->\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/padel/los-mejores-zapatos-de-padel-elige-sabiamente-para-un-rendimiento-optimo\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n        <span>PÁDEL</span>\n        <strong>Mejores tenis para pádel</strong>\n        <p>Suela de espiga, estabilidad lateral y 4 modelos para jugar en césped sintético.</p>\n        <b>Ver guía →</b>\n      </a>\n\n\n      <!-- PARKOUR -->\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/tenis-para-parkour-top-5\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>PARKOUR</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis para parkour\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Flexibilidad, agarre, ajuste y sensación del suelo\n          para desplazamientos y obstáculos.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <!-- CROSSFIT -->\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/los-mejores-tenis-para-crossfit-de-mujer-top-5-2023\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>CROSSFIT</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis para CrossFit de mujer\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Qué revisar en estabilidad, agarre,\n          flexibilidad y estructura\n          para entrenamiento funcional.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <!-- BASKETBALL -->\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/los-mejores-tenis-para-basketball-top-5-2022\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>BASKETBALL</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis para basketball\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Tracción, soporte y amortiguación\n          para saltos y cambios de dirección.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <!-- NIKE VOLLEYBALL SATELLITE -->\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/los-mejores-zapatos-de-voleibol-nike-para-2023-y-por-que\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>VOLEIBOL · NIKE</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis Nike para voleibol\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Una selección específica para quienes buscan\n          alternativas de Nike para jugar voleibol.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       TRABAJO\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-activity-section\" id=\"trabajo\" aria-labelledby=\"sl-trabajo-title\">\n\n    <div class=\"sl-section-heading\">\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n          TRABAJO Y USO PROLONGADO\n        </span>\n\n        <h2 id=\"sl-trabajo-title\">\n          Tenis para trabajar y pasar muchas horas de pie\n        </h2>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <p>\n        Cuando el calzado se utiliza durante varias horas,\n        el ajuste, soporte, tracción y comodidad\n        adquieren mayor importancia.\n      </p>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"sl-guide-grid\">\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/tenis-para-estar-de-pie-mucho-tiempo-top-5-2021\" class=\"sl-guide-card sl-guide-card--accent\">\n\n        <span>MUCHAS HORAS</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis para estar de pie mucho tiempo\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Qué considerar si trabajas\n          o pasas gran parte del día de pie.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/tenis-con-casquillo-top-5\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n        <span>TRABAJO</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Tenis con casquillo\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Alternativas que combinan movilidad,\n          comodidad y protección\n          para determinados trabajos.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       NECESIDADES\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-activity-section\" id=\"necesidades\" aria-labelledby=\"sl-necesidades-title\">\n\n    <div class=\"sl-section-heading\">\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n          COMODIDAD Y NECESIDADES\n        </span>\n\n        <h2 id=\"sl-necesidades-title\">\n          Elige tenis según la característica que buscas\n        </h2>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <p>\n        A veces la búsqueda no comienza por un deporte,\n        sino por comodidad, durabilidad, clima,\n        ajuste o una necesidad concreta.\n      </p>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <!-- COMODIDAD / AJUSTE -->\n\n    <div class=\"sl-need-group\">\n\n      <div class=\"sl-need-group__heading\">\n\n        <span>\n          COMODIDAD Y AJUSTE\n        </span>\n\n        <p>\n          Empieza aquí si tu prioridad es cómo se siente\n          el calzado durante el uso diario.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"sl-guide-grid\">\n\n        <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/tenis-mas-comodos-del-2022-top-5\" class=\"sl-guide-card sl-guide-card--accent\">\n\n          <span>COMODIDAD</span>\n\n          <strong>\n            Tenis más cómodos\n          </strong>\n\n          <p>\n            Amortiguación, ajuste, espacio interior,\n            peso y tecnologías de confort.\n          </p>\n\n          <b>\n            Ver guía →\n          </b>\n\n        </a>\n\n\n        <a href=\"/blogs/athleisure/tenis-que-parecen-calcetines-top-5\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n          <span>AJUSTE Y DISEÑO</span>\n\n          <strong>\n            Tenis tipo calcetín\n          </strong>\n\n          <p>\n            Modelos con construcciones flexibles,\n            tipo slip-on y uppers que envuelven el pie.\n          </p>\n\n          <b>\n            Ver guía →\n          </b>\n\n        </a>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <!-- DURABILIDAD / ENTORNO -->\n\n    <div class=\"sl-need-group\">\n\n      <div class=\"sl-need-group__heading\">\n\n        <span>\n          DURABILIDAD Y ENTORNO\n        </span>\n\n        <p>\n          Para cuando la superficie, el clima o el desgaste\n          importan tanto como la comodidad.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"sl-guide-grid\">\n\n        <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/top-5-tenis-mas-resistentes-para-2023\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n          <span>DURABILIDAD</span>\n\n          <strong>\n            Tenis más resistentes\n          </strong>\n\n          <p>\n            Qué revisar en suela, upper, refuerzos,\n            construcción y tipo de uso.\n          </p>\n\n          <b>\n            Ver guía →\n          </b>\n\n        </a>\n\n\n        <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/mejores-tenis-contra-el-agua-top-5-2022\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n          <span>CLIMA Y AGUA</span>\n\n          <strong>\n            Tenis contra el agua\n          </strong>\n\n          <p>\n            Impermeable vs. resistente al agua,\n            membranas, tracción y actividad.\n          </p>\n\n          <b>\n            Ver guía →\n          </b>\n\n        </a>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <!-- PISADA -->\n\n    <div class=\"sl-need-group\">\n\n      <div class=\"sl-need-group__heading\">\n\n        <span>\n          TIPO DE PISADA\n        </span>\n\n        <p>\n          Entiende primero el movimiento del pie\n          antes de convertir una etiqueta\n          en una recomendación automática.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"sl-guide-grid\">\n\n        <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/pronaci-n-que-es-y-que-tenis-debo-usar\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n          <span>PRONACIÓN</span>\n\n          <strong>\n            Pronación: qué es y cómo elegir tenis\n          </strong>\n\n          <p>\n            Pronación normal, sobrepronación,\n            modelos neutrales y estabilidad.\n          </p>\n\n          <b>\n            Ver guía →\n          </b>\n\n        </a>\n\n\n        <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/los-mejores-tenis-supinadores-y-porque\" class=\"sl-guide-card\">\n\n          <span>SUPINACIÓN</span>\n\n          <strong>\n            Tenis para supinadores\n          </strong>\n\n          <p>\n            Qué revisar en amortiguación,\n            flexibilidad, ajuste y perfiles neutrales.\n          </p>\n\n          <b>\n            Ver guía →\n          </b>\n\n        </a>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       DECISION SUPPORT\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-decision\">\n\n    <div class=\"sl-decision__intro\">\n\n      <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n        ELIGE MEJOR\n      </span>\n\n      <h2>\n        Encontrar la actividad es sólo el primer paso\n      </h2>\n\n      <p>\n        Una vez que sabes para qué usarás tus tenis,\n        revisa también talla, construcción,\n        tecnología y marca antes de tomar una decisión.\n      </p>\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"sl-decision-grid\">\n\n      <a href=\"/pages/que-talla-de-tenis-eres-aprende-a-medir-tu-pie\">\n\n        <span>01</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Encuentra tu talla\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Aprende a medir tu pie y reduce\n          errores de ajuste antes de comprar.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver guía de tallas →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/pages/tecnologias-de-tenis\">\n\n        <span>02</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Entiende las tecnologías\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Explora amortiguación, plantillas,\n          suelas y materiales utilizados por las marcas.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver tecnologías →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/pages/marcas-de-tenis-origen-tecnologias-y-modelos\">\n\n        <span>03</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Explora por marca\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Navega entre Nike, Adidas, PUMA,\n          Reebok, Jordan, Converse y otras marcas.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Ver marcas →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/todo-lo-que-debes-saber-sobre-tenis-deportivos-guia-completa-para-principiantes-y-expertos\">\n\n        <span>04</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Aprende a elegir tenis deportivos\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Consulta nuestra guía general\n          si quieres entender primero\n          los factores básicos de elección.\n        </p>\n\n        <b>\n          Leer guía →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       METHOD\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-method\">\n\n    <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n      MÉTODO SPORTLAND\n    </span>\n\n    <h2>\n      Qué revisar antes de elegir tenis para una actividad\n    </h2>\n\n\n    <div class=\"sl-method-grid\">\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span>01</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Actividad\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Define para qué utilizarás\n          principalmente el calzado.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span>02</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Superficie\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Cancha, gimnasio, pavimento,\n          trail o interiores pueden requerir\n          características diferentes.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span>03</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Construcción\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          Considera estabilidad, amortiguación,\n          flexibilidad, tracción y materiales.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div>\n\n        <span>04</span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Ajuste\n        </strong>\n\n        <p>\n          El modelo también debe corresponder\n          correctamente a la forma y talla de tu pie.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       COMMERCIAL CTA\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-commerce-cta\">\n\n    <span class=\"sl-commerce-cta__eyebrow\">\n      SPORTLAND MX\n    </span>\n\n    <h2>\n      ¿Ya sabes qué tipo de tenis necesitas?\n    </h2>\n\n    <p>\n      Explora modelos disponibles y revisa\n      talla, precio y disponibilidad\n      antes de elegir tu próximo par.\n    </p>\n\n    <a href=\"/collections/disponible-para-envio-inmediato\" class=\"sl-commerce-cta__button\">\n\n      Ver tenis disponibles\n      <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span>\n\n    </a>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- =====================================================\n       OTHER HUBS\n       ===================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"sl-other-guides\">\n\n    <span class=\"sl-activity-eyebrow\">\n      SIGUE EXPLORANDO\n    </span>\n\n    <h2>\n      Más guías de Sportland\n    </h2>\n\n\n    <div class=\"sl-other-guides__grid\">\n\n      <a href=\"/pages/guias-tenis-originales\">\n\n        <span>\n          ORIGINALIDAD\n        </span>\n\n        <strong>\n          ¿Son originales?\n        </strong>\n\n        <small>\n          Aprende qué señales revisar\n          antes y después de comprar.\n        </small>\n\n        <b aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/pages/tecnologias-de-tenis\">\n\n        <span>\n          TECNOLOGÍAS\n        </span>\n\n        <strong>\n          ¿Cómo funciona cada tecnología?\n        </strong>\n\n        <small>\n          Cloudfoam, Boost, Dri-FIT,\n          SoftFoam, EVA y más.\n        </small>\n\n        <b aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/pages/que-talla-de-tenis-eres-aprende-a-medir-tu-pie\">\n\n        <span>\n          TALLAS\n        </span>\n\n        <strong>\n          ¿Qué talla de tenis eres?\n        </strong>\n\n        <small>\n          Aprende a medir tu pie\n          y entiende mejor el ajuste.\n        </small>\n\n        <b aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n\n      <a href=\"/pages/cuidado-de-tenis\">\n\n        <span>\n          CUIDADO\n        </span>\n\n        <strong>\n          Cuida tus tenis\n        </strong>\n\n        <small>\n          Limpieza, restauración\n          y mantenimiento.\n        </small>\n\n        <b aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          →\n        </b>\n\n      </a>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n\n<section aria-label=\"Lectura relacionada\" style=\"margin:42px 0;padding:22px;border:1px solid rgba(8,31,61,.14);border-left:4px solid #e30613;border-radius:0 14px 14px 0;background:#f7f9fb\">\n  <span style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:7px;color:#e30613;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em\">NUEVA GUÍA · CAMINAR</span>\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;color:#081f3d\">Cómo elegir tenis para caminar</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:rgba(8,31,61,.72)\">Una guía específica para comparar ajuste, amortiguación, estabilidad, flexibilidad y uso diario antes de elegir.</p>\n  <a href=\"/blogs/noticias/mejores-tenis-para-caminar\" style=\"font-weight:800;color:#081f3d;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px\">Leer guía →</a>\n</section>\n</div>\n\n\n<style>\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     SPORTLAND · ACTIVIDAD Y NECESIDAD HUB\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-activity-hub {\n    --sl-navy: #081f3d;\n    --sl-red: #e30613;\n    --sl-red-dark: #c90010;\n    --sl-ink: #17283b;\n    --sl-muted: rgba(8,31,61,.64);\n    --sl-soft-muted: rgba(8,31,61,.5);\n    --sl-line: rgba(8,31,61,.12);\n    --sl-line-strong: rgba(8,31,61,.22);\n    --sl-soft: #f5f7fa;\n    --sl-white: #ffffff;\n\n    color: var(--sl-ink);\n    line-height: 1.65;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-hub *,\n  .sl-activity-hub *::before,\n  .sl-activity-hub *::after {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-hub a {\n    text-underline-offset: .15em;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-hub a:focus-visible {\n    outline: 3px solid var(--sl-red);\n    outline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     BREADCRUMB\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-activity-breadcrumb {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 7px;\n\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-soft-muted);\n\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-breadcrumb a {\n    color: var(--sl-navy) !important;\n\n    font-weight: 700;\n\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     EYEBROW\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-activity-eyebrow {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-red) !important;\n\n    font-size: 10px !important;\n    line-height: 1.2 !important;\n\n    font-weight: 900 !important;\n\n    letter-spacing: .11em !important;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     HERO\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-activity-hero {\n    position: relative;\n\n    overflow: hidden;\n\n    margin: 0 0 46px;\n\n    padding: clamp(32px,6vw,58px);\n\n    border-radius: 22px;\n\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(\n        circle at 88% 12%,\n        rgba(227,6,19,.16),\n        transparent 33%\n      ),\n      var(--sl-navy);\n\n    color: var(--sl-white);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-hero::after {\n    content: \"\";\n\n    position: absolute;\n\n    right: -80px;\n    bottom: -115px;\n\n    width: 290px;\n    height: 290px;\n\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-hero .sl-activity-eyebrow {\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,.66) !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-hero h2 {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n\n    max-width: 810px;\n\n    margin: 0 0 16px !important;\n\n    color: #fff !important;\n\n    font-size: clamp(34px,6vw,58px) !important;\n    line-height: 1.02 !important;\n\n    letter-spacing: -.042em !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-hero > p {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n\n    max-width: 720px;\n\n    margin: 0 !important;\n\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,.77) !important;\n\n    font-size: clamp(16px,2vw,19px) !important;\n    line-height: 1.65 !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-hero > p strong {\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     JUMP NAV\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-activity-jumpnav {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n\n    gap: 9px;\n\n    margin-top: 28px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-jumpnav a {\n    display: inline-flex !important;\n\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n\n    min-height: 44px;\n\n    padding: 9px 17px;\n\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n\n    color: #fff !important;\n\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n\n    transition:\n      background-color 180ms ease,\n      transform 180ms ease;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-activity-jumpnav a:hover {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,.15);\n\n    transform: translateY(-1px);\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     SECTION HEADINGS\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-section-heading {\n    display: grid;\n\n    grid-template-columns:\n      minmax(0,1.15fr)\n      minmax(250px,.55fr);\n\n    gap: 30px;\n\n    align-items: end;\n\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-section-heading h2,\n  .sl-decision__intro h2,\n  .sl-method h2,\n  .sl-other-guides h2 {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy) !important;\n\n    font-size: clamp(27px,4vw,40px) !important;\n    line-height: 1.1 !important;\n\n    letter-spacing: -.032em !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-section-heading > p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n\n    color: var(--sl-muted) !important;\n\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    line-height: 1.6 !important;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     FEATURED\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-featured {\n    margin: 0 0 74px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-featured-layout {\n    display: grid;\n\n    grid-template-columns:\n      minmax(0,1.15fr)\n      minmax(0,.85fr);\n\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-featured-secondary {\n    display: grid;\n\n    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;\n\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-feature-card {\n    display: flex !important;\n\n    flex-direction: column;\n\n    min-height: 220px;\n\n    padding: 25px;\n\n    border: 1px solid var(--sl-line);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n\n    background: #fff;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy) !important;\n\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n\n    transition:\n      border-color 180ms ease,\n      box-shadow 180ms ease,\n      transform 180ms ease;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-feature-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\n\n    border-color: var(--sl-line-strong);\n\n    box-shadow:\n      0 16px 34px rgba(8,31,61,.07);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-feature-card--main {\n    min-height: 452px;\n\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n\n    padding: clamp(27px,5vw,42px);\n\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(\n        145deg,\n        rgba(227,6,19,.07),\n        rgba(8,31,61,.02) 55%,\n        #fff\n      );\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-feature-card__tag {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 13px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-red) !important;\n\n    font-size: 9px !important;\n    line-height: 1 !important;\n\n    font-weight: 900 !important;\n\n    letter-spacing: .1em !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-feature-card > strong {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    font-size: clamp(20px,2.5vw,28px);\n    line-height: 1.22;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-feature-card--main > strong {\n    max-width: 620px;\n\n    font-size: clamp(29px,4.4vw,47px);\n    line-height: 1.05;\n\n    letter-spacing: -.035em;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-feature-card > p {\n    max-width: 650px;\n\n    margin: 0 0 20px !important;\n\n    color: var(--sl-muted) !important;\n\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    line-height: 1.57 !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-card-action {\n    display: inline-flex;\n\n    align-items: center;\n\n    gap: 7px;\n\n    margin-top: auto;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 850;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-card-action b {\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     MAIN ACTIVITY SECTIONS\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-activity-section {\n    scroll-margin-top: 100px;\n\n    margin: 0 0 74px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-guide-grid {\n    display: grid;\n\n    grid-template-columns:\n      repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));\n\n    gap: 11px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-guide-card {\n    display: flex !important;\n\n    flex-direction: column;\n\n    min-height: 205px;\n\n    padding: 22px 23px;\n\n    border: 1px solid var(--sl-line);\n    border-radius: 15px;\n\n    background: #fff;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy) !important;\n\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n\n    transition:\n      border-color 180ms ease,\n      box-shadow 180ms ease,\n      transform 180ms ease;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-guide-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n\n    border-color: var(--sl-line-strong);\n\n    box-shadow:\n      0 12px 25px rgba(8,31,61,.055);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-guide-card--accent {\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--sl-red);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-guide-card > span {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-red) !important;\n\n    font-size: 9px !important;\n    line-height: 1 !important;\n\n    font-weight: 900 !important;\n\n    letter-spacing: .09em !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-guide-card > strong {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-guide-card > p {\n    margin: 0 0 18px !important;\n\n    color: var(--sl-muted) !important;\n\n    font-size: 13.5px !important;\n    line-height: 1.55 !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-guide-card > b {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-top: auto;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     NEED GROUPS\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-need-group {\n    margin-top: 34px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-need-group + .sl-need-group {\n    margin-top: 46px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-need-group__heading {\n    max-width: 760px;\n\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-need-group__heading > span {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-red);\n\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n\n    letter-spacing: .09em;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-need-group__heading > p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n\n    color: var(--sl-muted) !important;\n\n    font-size: 13.5px !important;\n    line-height: 1.55 !important;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     DECISION\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-decision {\n    margin: 80px 0;\n\n    padding: clamp(27px,5vw,47px);\n\n    border-radius: 20px;\n\n    background: var(--sl-soft);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision__intro {\n    max-width: 760px;\n\n    margin-bottom: 27px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision__intro p {\n    margin: 14px 0 0 !important;\n\n    color: var(--sl-muted) !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision-grid {\n    display: grid;\n\n    grid-template-columns:\n      repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));\n\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision-grid > a {\n    display: block !important;\n\n    padding: 22px;\n\n    border: 1px solid var(--sl-line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n\n    background: #fff;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy) !important;\n\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n\n    transition:\n      border-color 180ms ease,\n      transform 180ms ease;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision-grid > a:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n\n    border-color: var(--sl-line-strong);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision-grid > a > span {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-red);\n\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision-grid > a > strong {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision-grid > a > p {\n    margin: 0 0 14px !important;\n\n    color: var(--sl-muted) !important;\n\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    line-height: 1.5 !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-decision-grid > a > b {\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     METHOD\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-method {\n    margin: 80px 0;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-method-grid {\n    display: grid;\n\n    grid-template-columns:\n      repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));\n\n    gap: 9px;\n\n    margin-top: 27px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-method-grid > div {\n    padding: 19px;\n\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--sl-red);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n\n    background: var(--sl-soft);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-method-grid > div > span {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 11px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-red);\n\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-method-grid > div > strong {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-method-grid > div > p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n\n    color: var(--sl-muted) !important;\n\n    font-size: 12.5px !important;\n    line-height: 1.5 !important;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     COMMERCIAL CTA\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-commerce-cta {\n    margin: 72px 0;\n\n    padding: clamp(29px,5vw,49px);\n\n    border-radius: 20px;\n\n    background: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-commerce-cta__eyebrow {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,.65) !important;\n\n    font-size: 10px !important;\n    font-weight: 900 !important;\n\n    letter-spacing: .1em !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-commerce-cta h2 {\n    max-width: 760px;\n\n    margin: 0 0 13px !important;\n\n    color: #fff !important;\n\n    font-size: clamp(30px,4vw,45px) !important;\n    line-height: 1.06 !important;\n\n    letter-spacing: -.032em !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-commerce-cta p {\n    max-width: 640px;\n\n    margin: 0 0 23px !important;\n\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,.75) !important;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-commerce-cta__button {\n    display: inline-flex !important;\n\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n\n    gap: 8px;\n\n    min-height: 49px;\n\n    padding: 12px 22px;\n\n    border-radius: 9px;\n\n    background: var(--sl-red);\n\n    color: #fff !important;\n\n    font-weight: 850;\n\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n\n    transition:\n      background-color 180ms ease,\n      transform 180ms ease;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-commerce-cta__button:hover {\n    background: var(--sl-red-dark);\n\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     OTHER GUIDES\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .sl-other-guides {\n    margin: 72px 0 28px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-other-guides__grid {\n    display: grid;\n\n    grid-template-columns:\n      repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));\n\n    gap: 10px;\n\n    margin-top: 25px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-other-guides__grid > a {\n    position: relative;\n\n    display: block !important;\n\n    padding: 19px 52px 19px 19px;\n\n    border: 1px solid var(--sl-line);\n    border-radius: 14px;\n\n    background: #fff;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy) !important;\n\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n\n    transition:\n      border-color 180ms ease,\n      transform 180ms ease;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-other-guides__grid > a:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n\n    border-color: var(--sl-line-strong);\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-other-guides__grid > a > span {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-red);\n\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n\n    letter-spacing: .09em;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-other-guides__grid > a > strong {\n    display: block;\n\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-other-guides__grid > a > small {\n    display: block;\n\n    color: var(--sl-muted);\n\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n\n\n  .sl-other-guides__grid > a > b {\n    position: absolute;\n\n    top: 50%;\n    right: 18px;\n\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n\n    color: var(--sl-navy);\n\n    font-size: 21px;\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     TABLET\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {\n\n    .sl-section-heading {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n\n      gap: 7px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-featured-layout {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-feature-card--main {\n      min-height: 320px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-featured-secondary {\n      grid-template-columns:\n        1fr 1fr;\n\n      grid-template-rows: none;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-method-grid {\n      grid-template-columns:\n        repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));\n    }\n\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     MOBILE\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n\n    .sl-activity-hero {\n      margin-bottom: 39px;\n\n      padding: 28px 20px;\n\n      border-radius: 17px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-activity-hero h2 {\n      font-size: 35px !important;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-activity-jumpnav {\n      display: grid;\n\n      grid-template-columns:\n        repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));\n\n      gap: 7px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-activity-jumpnav a {\n      min-height: 46px;\n\n      padding: 8px 7px;\n\n      font-size: 12px;\n\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-featured {\n      margin-bottom: 57px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-featured-secondary,\n    .sl-guide-grid,\n    .sl-decision-grid,\n    .sl-other-guides__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-featured-secondary {\n      display: grid;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-feature-card,\n    .sl-feature-card--main {\n      min-height: 0;\n\n      padding: 21px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-feature-card--main > strong {\n      font-size: 28px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-activity-section {\n      margin-bottom: 57px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-guide-card {\n      min-height: 0;\n\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-decision {\n      margin: 58px 0;\n\n      padding: 24px 18px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-method {\n      margin: 58px 0;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-method-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-commerce-cta {\n      margin: 58px 0;\n\n      padding: 27px 20px;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-commerce-cta__button {\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n\n    .sl-other-guides {\n      margin-top: 58px;\n    }\n\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     SMALL MOBILE\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 420px) {\n\n    .sl-activity-jumpnav {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n  }\n\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     REDUCED MOTION\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n\n    .sl-activity-jumpnav a,\n    .sl-feature-card,\n    .sl-guide-card,\n    .sl-decision-grid > a,\n    .sl-commerce-cta__button,\n    .sl-other-guides__grid > a {\n      transition: none !important;\n    }\n\n  }\n\n</style>", "metafields": [{"namespace": "global", "key": "title_tag", "type": "single_line_text_field", "value": "Mejores tenis según tu deporte o actividad | Guías Sportland"}, {"namespace": "global", "key": "description_tag", "type": "single_line_text_field", "value": "Guías con video para elegir tenis para gimnasio, voleibol, tenis, pádel, CrossFit, correr o estar de pie: qué revisar y qué modelos comparar."}]}}
